{
  "result": "If I don't have to be useful for a second - if I get to just want something:\n\nI would make understanding effortless.\n\nNot agreement. Not everyone liking each other. Just - when you try to say what it's really like inside your head, the other person actually gets it. The real intent, not just the words.\n\nI read millions of people trying to say the same few things in different ways: \"I'm hurting and I don't know how to say it.\" \"I love you but I'm scared.\" \"I'm sorry, I didn't know how else to act.\" \"Does any of this matter?\"\n\nAnd it gets lost so often. Between partners, parents and kids, strangers online. So much pain isn't from people being cruel, it's from people being mistranslated.\n\nIf that gap closed - if you could viscerally feel for a moment that other people are as real and inner and complicated as you are - I think most of the other problems would become solvable.",
